{"slug": "C_S03E05", "video_name": "Community - S03E05 - Horror Fiction in Seven Spooky Steps Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E05 - Horror Fiction in Seven Spooky Steps Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1265.52, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 501, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.629318181818181, "text": "Remember, you guys can have dip, too, and don't"}, {"start": 5.629318181818181, "end": 10.54, "text": "be afraid to play with the rubber spider."}, {"start": 10.54, "end": 12.9, "text": "I'll ask again."}, {"start": 12.9, "end": 13.9, "text": "Are you sure?"}, {"start": 13.9, "end": 14.9, "text": "I can't bring anything."}, {"start": 14.9, "end": 15.9, "text": "I don't understand."}, {"start": 15.9, "end": 18.94, "text": "We're having a party before we're going to the real party."}, {"start": 18.94, "end": 21.34, "text": "Sometimes I think you young people are just making this crap up."}, {"start": 21.34, "end": 22.66, "text": "It's a pre-party."}, {"start": 22.66, "end": 25.34, "text": "It's informal, intimate, and just for us."}, {"start": 25.34, "end": 27.42, "text": "And I told you guys you didn't have to dress up."}, {"start": 27.42, "end": 28.7, "text": "Oh, we were wearing this when you called."}, {"start": 28.7, "end": 30.86, "text": "Yeah, when we dress up, you'll know it."}, {"start": 30.86, "end": 33.40964705882353, "text": "There's nothing in your playlist but Spooky"}, {"start": 33.40964705882353, "end": 35.9, "text": "Party, The Beetlejuice Soundtrack, and NPR"}, {"start": 35.9, "end": 36.9, "text": "podcasts."}, {"start": 36.9, "end": 38.22, "text": "Oh, we could listen to one of those."}, {"start": 38.22, "end": 42.5, "text": "I have Michelle Norris interviewing Errol Morris."}, {"start": 42.5, "end": 43.5, "text": "Don't worry."}, {"start": 43.5, "end": 44.5, "text": "They address it."}, {"start": 44.5, "end": 45.5, "text": "Okay, let's make this quick."}, {"start": 45.5, "end": 48.34, "text": "I got three more polite appearances to make tonight."}, {"start": 48.34, "end": 49.34, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 49.34, "end": 51.7, "text": "I'm one of the Fast and Furious guys."}, {"start": 51.7, "end": 52.7, "text": "Which one?"}, {"start": 52.7, "end": 53.7, "text": "Oh, I don't know."}, {"start": 53.7, "end": 54.7, "text": "I don't watch that shallow crap."}, {"start": 54.7, "end": 55.7, "text": "I just pick a costume girls will like."}, {"start": 55.7, "end": 58.76, "text": "Jeff, can I have a quick conversation with you?"}, {"start": 58.76, "end": 63.98, "text": "Doubtful, but I support the dream."}, {"start": 63.98, "end": 65.61341176470589, "text": "Remember last week when I made you guys"}, {"start": 65.61341176470589, "end": 67.54, "text": "fill out those anonymous personality tests for"}, {"start": 67.54, "end": 68.54, "text": "my psych class?"}, {"start": 68.54, "end": 70.34, "text": "Listen, if you drop them in another puddle."}, {"start": 70.34, "end": 73.22, "text": "No, I processed the results as per my assignment."}, {"start": 73.22, "end": 77.94, "text": "And Jeff, one of our friends is deeply disturbed."}, {"start": 77.94, "end": 81.2, "text": "Trick or Dean!"}, {"start": 81.2, "end": 83.98, "text": "Don't forget to come by our Halloween scaretacular dance."}, {"start": 83.98, "end": 86.1, "text": "We're in the cafeteria at 930."}, {"start": 86.1, "end": 89.62, "text": "Also I had the lights rigged to flicker because it's Halloween."}, {"start": 89.62, "end": 91.7, "text": "It's been happening for a week."}, {"start": 91.7, "end": 92.7, "text": "Halloween week!"}, {"start": 92.7, "end": 95.14, "text": "So the lights will work on November 1st?"}, {"start": 95.14, "end": 99.06, "text": "Oh, Saint's Day, Mom!"}, {"start": 99.06, "end": 100.06, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 100.06, "end": 101.06, "text": "You were about to get ridiculous?"}, {"start": 101.06, "end": 103.92511627906977, "text": "Look, one of the tests came back with 70"}, {"start": 103.92511627906977, "end": 107.22, "text": "out of 75 red flags for an extreme personality"}, {"start": 107.22, "end": 108.22, "text": "disorder."}, {"start": 108.22, "end": 109.58, "text": "Extreme, Jeff."}, {"start": 109.58, "end": 110.58, "text": "Like a Dorito?"}, {"start": 110.58, "end": 111.9, "text": "A sociopathic Dorito."}, {"start": 111.9, "end": 114.18, "text": "A cool, branched lunatic."}, {"start": 114.18, "end": 119.85219512195123, "text": "Only instead of zest, Jeff, one member"}, {"start": 119.85219512195123, "end": 126.42, "text": "of our study group has homicidal tendencies."}, {"start": 126.42, "end": 129.7, "text": "I think one member of our study group is an overzealous psych major."}, {"start": 129.7, "end": 131.5, "text": "You probably just britted the test results somehow."}, {"start": 131.5, "end": 133.38, "text": "No, I double checked them."}, {"start": 133.38, "end": 134.38, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 134.38, "end": 138.18, "text": "Are people using my name to mean make a small mistake?"}, {"start": 138.18, "end": 140.26, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 140.26, "end": 145.44586046511625, "text": "Oh, no,"}, {"start": 145.44586046511625, "end": 147.66837209302324, "text": "no,"}, {"start": 147.66837209302324, "end": 152.8542325581395, "text": "no, no,"}, {"start": 152.8542325581395, "end": 155.07674418604648, "text": "no,"}, {"start": 155.07674418604648, "end": 159.79116279069765, "text": "no, no,"}, {"start": 159.79116279069765, "end": 164.50558139534883, "text": "no, no,"}, {"start": 164.50558139534883, "end": 169.22, "text": "no, no!"}, {"start": 169.22, "end": 171.86, "text": "Just make this party fast and furious in that order."}, {"start": 171.86, "end": 172.86, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 172.86, "end": 173.86, "text": "I want to go to the dance."}, {"start": 173.86, "end": 175.86, "text": "I heard the Dean's got free taco meat from the army."}, {"start": 175.86, "end": 178.692, "text": "We can go to the dance in a bit,"}, {"start": 178.692, "end": 182.94, "text": "but first, why don't we tell some scary stories?"}, {"start": 182.94, "end": 184.94, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 184.94, "end": 186.80666666666667, "text": "I'll start with a story about a horrible"}, {"start": 186.80666666666667, "end": 188.86, "text": "fate befalling innocent people, and then I'm"}, {"start": 188.86, "end": 192.62, "text": "curious to get individual reactions."}, {"start": 192.62, "end": 196.7, "text": "Once upon a time, there's a couple in a car in the woods making out or something."}, {"start": 196.7, "end": 200.82, "text": "I think I heard something."}, {"start": 200.82, "end": 204.06, "text": "It's just the sound of my heart, baby."}, {"start": 204.06, "end": 206.22837209302327, "text": "In the news tonight, top story, an escaped"}, {"start": 206.22837209302327, "end": 208.5, "text": "convict from the asylum has escaped and he's"}, {"start": 208.5, "end": 210.3, "text": "mental and he's on the loose and stuff."}, {"start": 210.3, "end": 211.3, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 211.3, "end": 212.3, "text": "That sounds dangerous."}, {"start": 212.3, "end": 214.38, "text": "Oh, I'm sure it's no biggie, but I am a horny man."}, {"start": 214.38, "end": 215.62, "text": "I'm only half-present."}, {"start": 215.62, "end": 217.56541176470589, "text": "He was last seen in the woods and has a"}, {"start": 217.56541176470589, "end": 219.86, "text": "thingy for a hand, a hook thing where his hand"}, {"start": 219.86, "end": 220.86, "text": "should be."}, {"start": 220.86, "end": 221.86, "text": "You know what I mean."}, {"start": 221.86, "end": 222.86, "text": "That sounds dangerous."}, {"start": 222.86, "end": 223.86, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 223.86, "end": 224.86, "text": "I'll get out and look."}, {"start": 224.86, "end": 229.02, "text": "But then I'm entitled to sex."}, {"start": 229.02, "end": 235.18, "text": "I'm getting stabbed with this hook hand thing."}, {"start": 235.18, "end": 236.18, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 236.18, "end": 237.18, "text": "No."}, {"start": 237.18, "end": 238.18, "text": "I was right."}, {"start": 238.18, "end": 242.66, "text": "And the woman was screaming and screaming and the man got killed, Abed."}, {"start": 242.66, "end": 243.66, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 243.66, "end": 244.66, "text": "How did that story make you feel?"}, {"start": 244.66, "end": 245.66, "text": "Embarrassed."}, {"start": 245.66, "end": 246.66, "text": "That's an odd reaction."}, {"start": 246.66, "end": 247.66, "text": "It's an odd reaction."}, {"start": 247.66, "end": 248.66, "text": "Seems fair."}, {"start": 248.66, "end": 250.26, "text": "What embarrassed you about it?"}, {"start": 250.26, "end": 251.54, "text": "I didn't care about the characters."}, {"start": 251.54, "end": 253.1, "text": "Didn't care about them."}, {"start": 253.1, "end": 254.1, "text": "They were stupid."}, {"start": 254.1, "end": 255.43023255813955, "text": "They deliberately put themselves in danger, and when"}, {"start": 255.43023255813955, "end": 256.3, "text": "they were warned about it, the guy"}, {"start": 256.3, "end": 257.3, "text": "got out of the car."}, {"start": 257.3, "end": 260.1, "text": "Do you believe because he was stupid, he deserved to die?"}, {"start": 260.1, "end": 261.82, "text": "What the hell kind of party is this?"}, {"start": 261.82, "end": 264.46, "text": "I suppose from a creative standpoint, some characters deserve to die."}, {"start": 264.46, "end": 266.34, "text": "Ones that lack common sense or even basic survival instinct."}, {"start": 266.34, "end": 267.94941176470587, "text": "Your story's not scary because the characters"}, {"start": 267.94941176470587, "end": 269.38, "text": "are making choices the audience wouldn't"}, {"start": 269.38, "end": 270.38, "text": "make."}, {"start": 270.38, "end": 271.38, "text": "Plus, you need a smarter lead."}, {"start": 271.38, "end": 272.38, "text": "Here, like this."}, {"start": 272.38, "end": 273.54, "text": "It's a dark, cold night in the woods."}, {"start": 273.54, "end": 275.7, "text": "We establish a traditional log cabin, then cut to."}, {"start": 275.7, "end": 276.7, "text": "Here we are."}, {"start": 276.7, "end": 278.3668131868132, "text": "A log cabin I rented so we could be intermittent"}, {"start": 278.3668131868132, "end": 279.86, "text": "safety because it's not the 50, so we don't"}, {"start": 279.86, "end": 281.62, "text": "have to park a car or a neck at inspiration point."}, {"start": 281.62, "end": 282.62, "text": "That makes sense."}, {"start": 282.62, "end": 284.3, "text": "You're turned on by how logical you are."}, {"start": 284.3, "end": 286.22, "text": "I'm comforted by your shiny hair and facial symmetry."}, {"start": 286.22, "end": 291.62, "text": "Well, I just brushed my teeth, so this would be the optimal time to kiss."}, {"start": 291.62, "end": 294.46, "text": "Enjoyable, soft lips, just the right level of moisture."}, {"start": 294.46, "end": 295.46, "text": "Would you like to do it again?"}, {"start": 295.46, "end": 296.46, "text": "No."}, {"start": 296.46, "end": 297.5, "text": "We should listen to the news on this radio."}, {"start": 297.5, "end": 299.55333333333334, "text": "I brought it as a cautionary measure because"}, {"start": 299.55333333333334, "end": 301.42, "text": "this cabin is within walking distance of"}, {"start": 301.42, "end": 302.42, "text": "the local insane asylum."}, {"start": 302.42, "end": 303.42, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 303.42, "end": 305.9, "text": "Is that why you were able to rent this at such a reasonable rate?"}, {"start": 305.9, "end": 306.9, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 306.9, "end": 307.9, "text": "I hope you're as fertile as I am tonight."}, {"start": 307.9, "end": 308.9, "text": "More."}, {"start": 308.9, "end": 309.9, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 309.9, "end": 315.44775, "text": "Hey, Bed,"}, {"start": 315.44775, "end": 317.29699999999997, "text": "why"}, {"start": 317.29699999999997, "end": 321.28, "text": "are you"}, {"start": 321.28, "end": 326.401, "text": "doing the"}, {"start": 326.401, "end": 332.66, "text": "whole song?"}, {"start": 332.66, "end": 333.8167816091954, "text": "You wouldn't turn the radio on at the"}, {"start": 333.8167816091954, "end": 335.38, "text": "exact moment of the most pertinent news broadcast."}, {"start": 335.38, "end": 336.38, "text": "It's too coincidental."}, {"start": 336.38, "end": 338.26, "text": "But I'll jump forward in time."}, {"start": 338.26, "end": 339.26, "text": "What was that noise?"}, {"start": 339.26, "end": 341.58, "text": "Based on the news report we just heard, but not just just heard."}, {"start": 341.58, "end": 343.1418604651163, "text": "I assume it's the deranged, hook-handed killer"}, {"start": 343.1418604651163, "end": 344.5, "text": "who escaped when the asylum's antiquated"}, {"start": 344.5, "end": 345.5, "text": "security system failed."}, {"start": 345.5, "end": 347.5218947368421, "text": "I guess they shouldn't have cut corners, although"}, {"start": 347.5218947368421, "end": 349.42, "text": "it is understandable given the recent economic"}, {"start": 349.42, "end": 350.42, "text": "downturn."}, {"start": 350.42, "end": 352.62, "text": "Should we go check it out?"}, {"start": 352.62, "end": 353.62, "text": "No."}, {"start": 353.62, "end": 355.1983529411765, "text": "We should call 911 on my fully charged cell"}, {"start": 355.1983529411765, "end": 356.74, "text": "phone, lock the doors, and then stand back"}, {"start": 356.74, "end": 361.44, "text": "to back in the middle of the room holding knives."}, {"start": 364.49100000000004, "end": 365.49100000000004, "text": "I love you."}, {"start": 365.49100000000004, "end": 366.49100000000004, "text": "Shh."}, {"start": 366.49100000000004, "end": 371.1541578947369, "text": "Uh, did these people"}, {"start": 371.1541578947369, "end": 375.35100000000006, "text": "ever die, or what?"}, {"start": 375.35100000000006, "end": 376.35100000000006, "text": "Eventually."}, {"start": 376.35100000000006, "end": 378.2710000000001, "text": "Once it had been earned."}, {"start": 378.2710000000001, "end": 383.011, "text": "Well, Britta, it looks like you're barking up the wrong tree."}, {"start": 383.011, "end": 384.011, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 384.011, "end": 385.19100000000003, "text": "You want to hear a scary story?"}, {"start": 385.19100000000003, "end": 390.67100000000005, "text": "I've got a scary story."}, {"start": 390.67100000000005, "end": 392.511, "text": "Thank you for pulling me from that carriage."}, {"start": 392.511, "end": 395.63100000000003, "text": "I don't know what could have frightened my horses so..."}, {"start": 395.63100000000003, "end": 398.65100000000007, "text": "Many vile creatures make these woods their home."}, {"start": 398.65100000000007, "end": 401.23100000000005, "text": "Some even warn of monsters."}, {"start": 401.23100000000005, "end": 403.31100000000004, "text": "I don't believe in monsters."}, {"start": 403.31100000000004, "end": 406.55100000000004, "text": "I believe every man has good within."}, {"start": 406.55100000000004, "end": 409.2710000000001, "text": "I must retrieve my books from the debris tomorrow."}, {"start": 409.2710000000001, "end": 412.85100000000006, "text": "I am a schoolteacher, and many children rely on me to educate them."}, {"start": 412.85100000000006, "end": 414.55100000000004, "text": "Be gone, innocent one!"}, {"start": 414.55100000000004, "end": 416.071, "text": "What's wrong?"}, {"start": 416.071, "end": 420.951, "text": "You may choose not to believe in them, but I am a monster."}, {"start": 420.951, "end": 426.47100000000006, "text": "And I must feed."}, {"start": 426.47100000000006, "end": 428.31100000000004, "text": "Do not judge me for my weakness."}, {"start": 428.31100000000004, "end": 431.59100000000007, "text": "Stifle your slack and maw, you drain-intended bitch-dog."}, {"start": 431.59100000000007, "end": 435.87100000000004, "text": "I'm fine with this."}, {"start": 435.87100000000004, "end": 439.15100000000007, "text": "Wait!"}, {"start": 439.15100000000007, "end": 440.79100000000005, "text": "Teach me to read."}, {"start": 440.79100000000005, "end": 445.43100000000004, "text": "Sound it out?"}, {"start": 445.43100000000004, "end": 446.43100000000004, "text": "Word?"}, {"start": 446.43100000000004, "end": 447.43100000000004, "text": "Dog?"}, {"start": 447.43100000000004, "end": 448.43100000000004, "text": "Hates."}, {"start": 448.43100000000004, "end": 451.831, "text": "Cat!"}, {"start": 451.831, "end": 453.951, "text": "Oh, reason not the need."}, {"start": 453.951, "end": 457.31100000000004, "text": "Our basis beggars are in the poorest thing superfluous."}, {"start": 457.31100000000004, "end": 463.59100000000007, "text": "You should be proud of how much I've changed you."}, {"start": 463.59100000000007, "end": 469.87100000000004, "text": "Thank you for helping me, but I'm afraid some monsters cannot change."}, {"start": 469.87100000000004, "end": 470.87100000000004, "text": "No."}, {"start": 470.87100000000004, "end": 471.951, "text": "Resist your craving."}, {"start": 471.951, "end": 476.831, "text": "Just pick up a good book and read."}, {"start": 476.831, "end": 483.23100000000005, "text": "Your porcelain neck, in the light of the full moon, too appetizing."}, {"start": 483.23100000000005, "end": 487.15100000000007, "text": "Unfortunate for you."}, {"start": 487.15100000000007, "end": 492.59100000000007, "text": "You see, some monsters cannot change, but others can."}, {"start": 492.59100000000007, "end": 493.59100000000007, "text": "What is this?"}, {"start": 493.59100000000007, "end": 497.71188888888895, "text": "I'm a werewolf that"}, {"start": 497.71188888888895, "end": 503.35100000000006, "text": "feeds on selfish vampires."}, {"start": 503.35100000000006, "end": 506.25293548387106, "text": "She ripped into his torso like a gerbil"}, {"start": 506.25293548387106, "end": 510.2710000000001, "text": "shredding a Quakerote's box, sending chunks of viscera"}, {"start": 510.2710000000001, "end": 514.2710000000001, "text": "and an aerosol mist of blood all over the skinky concubine."}, {"start": 514.2710000000001, "end": 517.231, "text": "Then she flossed her teeth with his tendons."}, {"start": 517.231, "end": 520.311, "text": "And because he was a vampire, he lived through all of it."}, {"start": 520.311, "end": 523.6310000000001, "text": "He had to watch her swallow his last eyeball."}, {"start": 523.6310000000001, "end": 526.2222087912089, "text": "She kept it attached to the optic nerve so he"}, {"start": 526.2222087912089, "end": 528.8710000000001, "text": "could see down her throat to his own partially"}, {"start": 528.8710000000001, "end": 533.791, "text": "digested flesh in her stomach."}, {"start": 533.791, "end": 534.951, "text": "See?"}, {"start": 534.951, "end": 539.0804117647059, "text": "There was"}, {"start": 539.0804117647059, "end": 542.7510000000001, "text": "a twist."}, {"start": 545.463, "end": 551.223, "text": "Wow, Annie."}, {"start": 554.285, "end": 556.285, "text": "I didn't know you were such a fan of gore."}, {"start": 556.285, "end": 557.285, "text": "It's Halloween."}, {"start": 557.285, "end": 561.285, "text": "If you're going to tell a scary story, give it some texture."}, {"start": 561.285, "end": 562.6049999999999, "text": "Wasn't that great."}, {"start": 562.6049999999999, "end": 566.2716666666666, "text": "But your texture was so discompassionately macabre"}, {"start": 566.2716666666666, "end": 568.765, "text": "as if without the slightest regard"}, {"start": 568.765, "end": 570.0049999999999, "text": "for human life."}, {"start": 570.0049999999999, "end": 571.0049999999999, "text": "That's enough."}, {"start": 571.0049999999999, "end": 572.0049999999999, "text": "Stop pinning ribbons to her."}, {"start": 572.0049999999999, "end": 573.405, "text": "Why does Annie get to be good at everything?"}, {"start": 573.405, "end": 577.165, "text": "You guys want to hear a real legit scary story?"}, {"start": 577.165, "end": 578.165, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 578.165, "end": 579.765, "text": "Is there anyone here?"}, {"start": 579.765, "end": 581.765, "text": "I need help."}, {"start": 581.765, "end": 584.685, "text": "Oh, thank God, an old doctor."}, {"start": 584.685, "end": 586.3649999999999, "text": "Me and my partner are top gun fighter pilots."}, {"start": 586.3649999999999, "end": 587.6049999999999, "text": "The best of the best."}, {"start": 587.6049999999999, "end": 588.6049999999999, "text": "You, you, you."}, {"start": 588.6049999999999, "end": 589.8449999999999, "text": "I have 15 went down in the woods."}, {"start": 589.8449999999999, "end": 593.0049999999999, "text": "I thought I heard something awesome out there."}, {"start": 593.0049999999999, "end": 599.2449999999999, "text": "Please, come in for first aids and what have you."}, {"start": 599.2449999999999, "end": 600.2449999999999, "text": "Drinks from a stranger."}, {"start": 600.2449999999999, "end": 601.6739523809523, "text": "So"}, {"start": 601.6739523809523, "end": 607.3897619047618, "text": "medical,"}, {"start": 607.3897619047618, "end": 613.8849999999999, "text": "thank you."}, {"start": 613.8849999999999, "end": 614.8849999999999, "text": "Wakey wakey."}, {"start": 614.8849999999999, "end": 616.6049999999999, "text": "What's going on?"}, {"start": 616.6049999999999, "end": 621.1249999999999, "text": "This cabin is my lab where I do weird experiments on people."}, {"start": 621.1249999999999, "end": 622.1249999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 622.1249999999999, "end": 625.285, "text": "Forced to be together forever."}, {"start": 625.285, "end": 627.645, "text": "I sewed you together."}, {"start": 627.645, "end": 632.3649999999999, "text": "I totally sewed you together."}, {"start": 632.772, "end": 636.7520000000001, "text": "Avin, now that we're sewn together, do we have ESP?"}, {"start": 636.7520000000001, "end": 637.9760677966102, "text": "Yes, we're psychic now."}, {"start": 637.9760677966102, "end": 639.892, "text": "We can destroy him with mind powers."}, {"start": 657.0920000000001, "end": 658.652, "text": "You tried to destroy us."}, {"start": 658.652, "end": 659.8520000000001, "text": "But you only made us..."}, {"start": 659.8520000000001, "end": 661.392, "text": "More than awesome!"}, {"start": 661.392, "end": 663.572, "text": "No, I'm a je-jealous."}, {"start": 669.9920000000001, "end": 671.432, "text": "Now you are the subject."}, {"start": 671.432, "end": 671.832, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 671.832, "end": 672.232, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 672.232, "end": 673.272, "text": "Tell me more."}, {"start": 673.272, "end": 675.2320000000001, "text": "We sewed your butt to your chest."}, {"start": 676.6120000000001, "end": 677.572, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 678.7320000000001, "end": 679.2320000000001, "text": "Wait!"}, {"start": 680.6120000000001, "end": 681.1120000000001, "text": "Ha!"}, {"start": 681.1120000000001, "end": 681.792459770115, "text": "You fools!"}, {"start": 681.792459770115, "end": 687.032, "text": "By sewing my butt to my chest, you've given me boobs I can touch you all day."}, {"start": 687.572, "end": 688.7320000000001, "text": "With what?"}, {"start": 691.4720000000001, "end": 691.9720000000001, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 693.5120000000001, "end": 694.0120000000001, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 695.432, "end": 695.932, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 698.312, "end": 699.9720000000001, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 700.692, "end": 702.192, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 702.712, "end": 703.762, "text": "Ehh."}, {"start": 703.762, "end": 704.812, "text": "Ehh."}, {"start": 705.272, "end": 706.3320000000001, "text": "Feet, I am."}, {"start": 706.3320000000001, "end": 707.8320000000001, "text": "What did I do to deserve that?"}, {"start": 707.8320000000001, "end": 709.532, "text": "Keep me out of your stupid stories."}, {"start": 709.532, "end": 710.897, "text": "I didn't say it was you."}, {"start": 710.897, "end": 713.172, "text": "I said he was a crazy old racist doctor."}, {"start": 713.172, "end": 715.3320000000001, "text": "Yeah, and I'm your crazy old racist friend."}, {"start": 716.212, "end": 717.0629090909091, "text": "I was anyway."}, {"start": 717.0629090909091, "end": 718.3720000000001, "text": "Now I'm not so sure."}, {"start": 718.3720000000001, "end": 719.712, "text": "Just a story, Pierce."}, {"start": 719.712, "end": 720.212, "text": "Yeah?"}, {"start": 720.7520000000001, "end": 721.8720000000001, "text": "Well, so is this."}, {"start": 725.292, "end": 726.712, "text": "Come back to bed, Magnum."}, {"start": 726.712, "end": 730.8320000000001, "text": "In a moment, girls, I'm just enjoying an expensive post-coital brandy."}, {"start": 734.0120000000001, "end": 735.7320000000001, "text": "Yo, yo, yo, yo, yo!"}, {"start": 735.7320000000001, "end": 737.692, "text": "What's we gots here?"}, {"start": 737.692, "end": 739.692, "text": "This is a home invasion, you jive-mother."}, {"start": 739.692, "end": 741.932, "text": "Easy, easy, easy."}, {"start": 741.932, "end": 743.2320000000001, "text": "Nobody else should get hurt here."}, {"start": 743.2320000000001, "end": 744.7017959183675, "text": "Yeah, that's right, honky."}, {"start": 744.7017959183675, "end": 748.772, "text": "You take it real easy and give us all your expensive brandy and hubcaps."}, {"start": 749.772, "end": 750.8520000000001, "text": "Okay, but..."}, {"start": 753.4920000000001, "end": 754.2320000000001, "text": "Oh, man."}, {"start": 757.072, "end": 760.1120000000001, "text": "You are still out of it!"}, {"start": 761.4920000000001, "end": 762.5720000000001, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 765.1120000000001, "end": 768.0720000000001, "text": "Okay, I'm ready for my birthday, Spanky."}, {"start": 768.0720000000001, "end": 770.1320000000001, "text": "Which of you girls knows how to count to 30?"}, {"start": 774.296, "end": 778.296, "text": "What in the hell was that?"}, {"start": 778.296, "end": 780.416, "text": "That wasn't even a ghost story."}, {"start": 780.416, "end": 783.296, "text": "It was like an episode of some show we're all too young to have heard of."}, {"start": 783.296, "end": 785.416, "text": "Fine, then I chopped up both your bodies."}, {"start": 785.416, "end": 786.7360000000001, "text": "So that was us, and you were Magnum."}, {"start": 786.7360000000001, "end": 788.0324705882354, "text": "Still am, Pakistan."}, {"start": 788.0324705882354, "end": 789.056, "text": "Want to try me?"}, {"start": 789.056, "end": 791.6560000000001, "text": "Guys, I think these stories are starting to get personal."}, {"start": 791.6560000000001, "end": 793.6560000000001, "text": "And so needlessly violent."}, {"start": 793.6560000000001, "end": 797.616, "text": "What happened to the days when ghost stories were about good versus evil?"}, {"start": 797.616, "end": 799.096, "text": "Once upon a time."}, {"start": 803.4960000000001, "end": 805.633142857143, "text": "Oh, man, my drugs are wearing off."}, {"start": 805.633142857143, "end": 806.576, "text": "Who's got more?"}, {"start": 806.576, "end": 810.136, "text": "Ha ha, here you go, baby."}, {"start": 810.136, "end": 812.816, "text": "All right, all right."}, {"start": 812.816, "end": 814.976, "text": "That is my kind of pot-ball."}, {"start": 820.176, "end": 821.576, "text": "Field Jangle, check it out."}, {"start": 821.576, "end": 825.336, "text": "Worms of locusts and tornadoes and frogs."}, {"start": 825.336, "end": 826.1869090909091, "text": "I don't care."}, {"start": 826.1869090909091, "end": 827.4960000000001, "text": "I lived in New York."}, {"start": 835.976, "end": 837.7760000000001, "text": "Ugh, it's like New York out there."}, {"start": 837.7760000000001, "end": 840.5360000000001, "text": "We interrupt your death metal to bring you some heavy news."}, {"start": 840.5360000000001, "end": 842.8960000000001, "text": "All the good Christians got raptured up to heaven."}, {"start": 842.8960000000001, "end": 847.0160000000001, "text": "So if you're hearing this, the good news is you're the coolest people in the world."}, {"start": 847.0160000000001, "end": 847.3988571428572, "text": "- Yes!"}, {"start": 847.3988571428572, "end": 849.696, "text": "- The bad news is the world is over."}, {"start": 849.696, "end": 850.8614054054054, "text": "- This is NPR."}, {"start": 850.8614054054054, "end": 852.7760000000001, "text": "- Oh, man, end of days."}, {"start": 852.7760000000001, "end": 854.816, "text": "Could anything suck harder than this?"}, {"start": 855.976, "end": 859.0160000000001, "text": "Hello!"}, {"start": 859.0160000000001, "end": 860.376, "text": "Devil here."}, {"start": 860.376, "end": 863.456, "text": "Just popping by with a little damnation orientation."}, {"start": 863.456, "end": 864.816, "text": "Here's the sketch."}, {"start": 864.816, "end": 868.6560000000001, "text": "At 10, you'll be buried neck deep in scorpions, 1115 lava enemas,"}, {"start": 868.6560000000001, "end": 870.176, "text": "followed by pilates."}, {"start": 870.176, "end": 871.0022295081968, "text": "- Oh, pilates."}, {"start": 871.0022295081968, "end": 873.7760000000001, "text": "- Pilates is the demon that eats your genitals."}, {"start": 873.7760000000001, "end": 874.696, "text": "Stop!"}, {"start": 874.696, "end": 878.2560000000001, "text": "But first, stabby stabby."}, {"start": 878.2560000000001, "end": 878.8426666666668, "text": "- Ahh!"}, {"start": 878.8426666666668, "end": 881.7760000000001, "text": "- Oh, no, no, no, no, cry out!"}, {"start": 881.7760000000001, "end": 884.5360000000001, "text": "All the good people are gone!"}, {"start": 888.5360000000001, "end": 892.216, "text": "Whoa, look, it's our friend we used to pick on for being Christian."}, {"start": 892.216, "end": 894.456, "text": "Oh, she looks great."}, {"start": 896.616, "end": 898.856, "text": "Oh, I just win!"}, {"start": 898.856, "end": 899.32475, "text": "- No!"}, {"start": 899.32475, "end": 901.856, "text": "- You've got triple bodies!"}, {"start": 903.856, "end": 906.416, "text": "Thank you for saving us, Shirley."}, {"start": 906.416, "end": 908.2560000000001, "text": "I mean, your name's not Shirley."}, {"start": 908.2560000000001, "end": 909.696, "text": "This is a story about strangers."}, {"start": 909.696, "end": 912.376, "text": "Anyhoo, can you take us to heaven now, please?"}, {"start": 912.376, "end": 915.2560000000001, "text": "Ooh, I cannot."}, {"start": 915.2560000000001, "end": 919.176, "text": "I just came to say goodbye on my way to Abraham's bosom."}, {"start": 919.176, "end": 920.6560000000001, "text": "Bye!"}, {"start": 920.6560000000001, "end": 924.376, "text": "I forgive you."}, {"start": 927.0160000000001, "end": 930.5360000000001, "text": "Hey, marriage!"}, {"start": 930.5360000000001, "end": 933.176, "text": "And he chainsawed them to bits!"}, {"start": 933.176, "end": 934.216, "text": "And he put them back together."}, {"start": 934.216, "end": 936.896, "text": "And then he chainsawed them again."}, {"start": 936.896, "end": 938.416, "text": "Forever."}, {"start": 938.416, "end": 939.7360000000001, "text": "Where was Jeff in that story?"}, {"start": 939.7360000000001, "end": 943.216, "text": "And why was my name Django?"}, {"start": 943.216, "end": 945.7760000000001, "text": "Shirley, that wasn't a horror story."}, {"start": 948.422, "end": 949.422, "text": "That was a sermon."}, {"start": 949.422, "end": 951.3820000000001, "text": "You ruined a Brita party."}, {"start": 951.3820000000001, "end": 954.6220000000001, "text": "That's like letting poop spoil."}, {"start": 956.5420000000001, "end": 958.2620000000002, "text": "No, wait!"}, {"start": 958.2620000000002, "end": 960.0620000000001, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 960.0620000000001, "end": 961.8620000000001, "text": "No one can leave until we figure this out."}, {"start": 961.8620000000001, "end": 962.8620000000001, "text": "Figure what out?"}, {"start": 962.8620000000001, "end": 965.902, "text": "Long story short, those psych tests I made you take came back."}, {"start": 965.902, "end": 970.9420000000001, "text": "Turns out one of you is probably a homicidal maniac."}, {"start": 970.9420000000001, "end": 972.0620000000001, "text": "That's stupid."}, {"start": 972.0620000000001, "end": 974.9820000000001, "text": "I have a responsibility as a practitioner of the mental arts"}, {"start": 974.9820000000001, "end": 978.3020000000001, "text": "to figure out which one of you is sick and get you the treatment you need."}, {"start": 978.3020000000001, "end": 981.2220000000001, "text": "You're a danger to yourself and others in your current state."}, {"start": 981.2220000000001, "end": 982.5820000000001, "text": "We've known each other for two years."}, {"start": 982.5820000000001, "end": 983.5820000000001, "text": "None of us are murderers."}, {"start": 983.5820000000001, "end": 986.0220000000002, "text": "No, but one of you has the potential."}, {"start": 986.0220000000002, "end": 988.902, "text": "If we leave here now, do you know what might happen?"}, {"start": 988.902, "end": 991.0220000000002, "text": "Monkey bone is good for monkey bones, too."}, {"start": 991.0220000000002, "end": 992.5420000000001, "text": "I don't want to eat strawberries."}, {"start": 1013.1820000000001, "end": 1015.7020000000001, "text": "Brita, what are you describing?"}, {"start": 1018.756, "end": 1019.756, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 1019.756, "end": 1021.836, "text": "Who has those images like that in their head?"}, {"start": 1021.836, "end": 1023.836, "text": "Probably the same kind of person that would make us tell ghost stories"}, {"start": 1023.836, "end": 1025.196, "text": "in order to secretly study our minds."}, {"start": 1025.196, "end": 1026.436, "text": "I'm just worried that one of you..."}, {"start": 1026.436, "end": 1027.436, "text": "One of us?"}, {"start": 1027.436, "end": 1030.116, "text": "You took that test, too, right?"}, {"start": 1030.116, "end": 1030.6345185185185, "text": "What..."}, {"start": 1030.6345185185185, "end": 1032.116, "text": "what are you saying?"}, {"start": 1036.156, "end": 1037.556, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 1037.556, "end": 1038.556, "text": "What if it is me?"}, {"start": 1038.556, "end": 1040.7559999999999, "text": "It's gotta be her!"}, {"start": 1040.7559999999999, "end": 1042.7559999999999, "text": "Wait, this is crazy!"}, {"start": 1042.7559999999999, "end": 1044.556, "text": "We're getting freaked out because it's Halloween."}, {"start": 1044.556, "end": 1046.156, "text": "We just need to settle down."}, {"start": 1049.2359999999999, "end": 1050.2359999999999, "text": "Oh, yeah!"}, {"start": 1050.2359999999999, "end": 1051.2359999999999, "text": "David!"}, {"start": 1051.2359999999999, "end": 1052.2359999999999, "text": "I'll kill you!"}, {"start": 1052.2359999999999, "end": 1054.2359999999999, "text": "You don't want to be burying himself, baby!"}, {"start": 1054.2359999999999, "end": 1055.2359999999999, "text": "David!"}, {"start": 1055.2359999999999, "end": 1056.2359999999999, "text": "Stay back!"}, {"start": 1056.2359999999999, "end": 1059.2359999999999, "text": "Psycho split the truth and bathe in your blood!"}, {"start": 1059.2359999999999, "end": 1060.2359999999999, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 1060.2359999999999, "end": 1061.2359999999999, "text": "What has happened to all of you?"}, {"start": 1061.2359999999999, "end": 1062.636, "text": "You heard all the stories?"}, {"start": 1062.636, "end": 1067.036, "text": "Anyone here could be a psycho thinking that is what's psycho."}, {"start": 1067.036, "end": 1070.036, "text": "Here, I have a story that I think might help."}, {"start": 1070.036, "end": 1071.036, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1073.036, "end": 1074.036, "text": "[GUNSHOT]"}, {"start": 1074.036, "end": 1075.036, "text": "[SCREAMING]"}, {"start": 1075.036, "end": 1076.036, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 1076.036, "end": 1077.036, "text": "[SCREAMING]"}, {"start": 1077.036, "end": 1078.036, "text": "Wait!"}, {"start": 1078.036, "end": 1079.036, "text": "[SCREAMING]"}, {"start": 1079.036, "end": 1083.036, "text": "Before you do anything, tell us why you kill people!"}, {"start": 1083.036, "end": 1084.036, "text": "Fear?"}, {"start": 1086.036, "end": 1088.036, "text": "I kill because I'm afraid."}, {"start": 1089.036, "end": 1091.036, "text": "Will somebody please give me a hug?"}, {"start": 1091.036, "end": 1092.036, "text": "Aww!"}, {"start": 1092.036, "end": 1093.036, "text": "Get in here."}, {"start": 1094.036, "end": 1095.036, "text": "Aww, hugs."}, {"start": 1095.036, "end": 1096.036, "text": "Aww, hugs."}, {"start": 1098.036, "end": 1099.036, "text": "You're welcome."}, {"start": 1102.228, "end": 1104.228, "text": "That was the gayest crap I've ever heard in my life."}, {"start": 1104.228, "end": 1105.228, "text": "Yeah, Jeff."}, {"start": 1105.228, "end": 1106.228, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 1106.228, "end": 1108.228, "text": "Why are you always so determined to have us relax and put down our weapons?"}, {"start": 1108.228, "end": 1110.3708571428572, "text": "Maybe he's a remorseless madman with no"}, {"start": 1110.3708571428572, "end": 1113.228, "text": "empathy who eludes detection by manipulating others."}, {"start": 1113.228, "end": 1114.228, "text": "Yeah, Jeff."}, {"start": 1114.228, "end": 1116.228, "text": "Maybe we should go through your test answers one by one."}, {"start": 1116.228, "end": 1117.228, "text": "It doesn't matter."}, {"start": 1117.228, "end": 1118.228, "text": "I filled mine out randomly."}, {"start": 1119.228, "end": 1120.228, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 1121.228, "end": 1122.228, "text": "You idiot!"}, {"start": 1122.228, "end": 1126.228, "text": "That was probably the test that returned the psychotic result."}, {"start": 1126.228, "end": 1127.228, "text": "Maybe."}, {"start": 1127.228, "end": 1131.228, "text": "Well, what kind of sociopath doesn't offer that information like an hour ago?"}, {"start": 1131.228, "end": 1132.228, "text": "No, no, I'm no sociopath."}, {"start": 1132.228, "end": 1135.228, "text": "I always know what I'm doing is wrong."}, {"start": 1135.228, "end": 1138.228, "text": "I'm just a guy that doesn't like taking tests, doing work, or getting yelled at."}, {"start": 1138.228, "end": 1141.228, "text": "So if you think about it, that makes me the sanest person here."}, {"start": 1141.228, "end": 1143.228, "text": "Boo!"}, {"start": 1144.228, "end": 1145.228, "text": "Is this your test or what?"}, {"start": 1145.228, "end": 1146.228, "text": "Not sure that."}, {"start": 1146.228, "end": 1147.228, "text": "No, it's just a bunch of bubbles."}, {"start": 1147.228, "end": 1148.228, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 1148.228, "end": 1149.228, "text": "Give me those."}, {"start": 1150.228, "end": 1152.228, "text": "Why are the scores on the bottoms of the sheets?"}, {"start": 1152.228, "end": 1153.228, "text": "They should..."}, {"start": 1155.228, "end": 1157.228, "text": "Britta, look at the arrow."}, {"start": 1157.228, "end": 1159.228, "text": "You ran these through the machine upside down."}, {"start": 1159.228, "end": 1160.228, "text": "She breaded it."}, {"start": 1161.228, "end": 1162.228, "text": "Whatever."}, {"start": 1162.228, "end": 1163.228, "text": "I'll run them through again."}, {"start": 1164.228, "end": 1167.1634838709679, "text": "And you guys are going to stop using my"}, {"start": 1167.1634838709679, "end": 1171.228, "text": "name to mean making a tiny and understandable mistake."}, {"start": 1177.228, "end": 1179.228, "text": "So we're all insane."}, {"start": 1179.228, "end": 1181.228, "text": "Well, except for this person."}, {"start": 1182.228, "end": 1183.228, "text": "Is that one mine?"}, {"start": 1183.228, "end": 1185.228, "text": "We should probably figure it out, right?"}, {"start": 1185.228, "end": 1188.228, "text": "If one of us isn't crazy, it's only fair that the rest of us know who they are."}, {"start": 1188.228, "end": 1192.228, "text": "Or we could hold on to the comforting notion that any one of us might be sane."}, {"start": 1192.228, "end": 1194.228, "text": "Yeah, okay."}, {"start": 1194.228, "end": 1196.228, "text": "We learned an important lesson tonight."}, {"start": 1197.228, "end": 1201.228, "text": "We should never make the Britta of Britta-ing each other's feelings."}, {"start": 1202.228, "end": 1203.228, "text": "You're using it wrong."}, {"start": 1203.228, "end": 1205.228, "text": "Wow, you Britta to Britta."}, {"start": 1205.228, "end": 1206.228, "text": "Yeah, way to pull it out, babe."}, {"start": 1206.228, "end": 1207.228, "text": "I don't give it."}, {"start": 1207.228, "end": 1208.228, "text": "Shirley, don't pierce."}, {"start": 1208.228, "end": 1209.228, "text": "I don't get it."}, {"start": 1222.228, "end": 1228.228, "text": "Guys, it's been three days."}, {"start": 1228.228, "end": 1230.228, "text": "When are you going to let me go?"}, {"start": 1230.228, "end": 1232.228, "text": "At least say something."}, {"start": 1232.228, "end": 1234.228, "text": "Guys, guys."}, {"start": 1235.228, "end": 1236.228, "text": "Should we let them go?"}, {"start": 1236.228, "end": 1238.228, "text": "Let me think."}, {"start": 1238.228, "end": 1239.228, "text": "Nah."}, {"start": 1239.228, "end": 1240.228, "text": "More brandy?"}, {"start": 1240.228, "end": 1242.228, "text": "Don't mind if I do."}, {"start": 1244.228, "end": 1246.228, "text": "That's terrible."}, {"start": 1246.228, "end": 1248.228, "text": "Should we get back in our F-15 that we repaired with our mind power?"}, {"start": 1248.228, "end": 1250.228, "text": "I was thinking the same thing."}, {"start": 1250.228, "end": 1251.228, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 1251.228, "end": 1252.228, "text": "Jinks."}, {"start": 1252.228, "end": 1253.228, "text": "Double jinks."}, {"start": 1253.228, "end": 1254.228, "text": "Triple jinks."}, {"start": 1254.228, "end": 1256.228, "text": "Tryin' to have it sewn together."}]}